meta {
  name: Get Widget Key (Service)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/retailer/widget-key/RECOMMENDATION
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## GET /api/retailer/widget-key/:service

  Retrieves (or lazily provisions) the public widget API key for a specific service.
  Also returns the current subscription status and allowed origins.

  ### Path Params — Valid Services
  | Value           | Description                          |
  |-----------------|--------------------------------------|
  | RECOMMENDATION  | AI size recommendation widget        |
  | VTON_2D         | 2D Virtual try-on widget             |
  | BODY_MODELING   | 3D body modelling service            |

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "service": "RECOMMENDATION",
    "apiKey": "mk_pub_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "isActivated": true,
    "allowedOrigins": ["https://myshop.com"],
    "subscription": {
      "planName": "Growth",
      "quota": 5000,
      "usage": 123
    }
  }
  ```

  > **Tip:** Paste `apiKey` into your Bruno environment's `apiKey` variable
  > to test all widget/orchestration endpoints.
}
